    <Package test_correction_metrics>
      <Module test_batch_prediction.py>
        Per-image statistics hook for batch pre-labelling (task 4.3).
        
        ``batch.save_auto_labeling_result`` is the only place a batch prediction is
        written, and it is shared by both batch drivers (the UI-thread loop in
        ``process_next_image`` and the worker ``BatchProcessingThread``).  These tests
        pin that boundary without Qt widgets, a real model, or a real controller:
        
        * one notification per image, after the atomic write succeeded;
        * ``applied`` carries the image, the label file, the provenance and the exact
          shapes that were saved;
        * a failed write and a missing prediction are reported as ``failed`` /
          ``skipped`` and never as applied;
        * a partly failed batch does not become an all-success statement;
        * statistics must never start timing, finish a round, or break annotation
          saving when the observer is absent or raises.
        <Function test_three_saved_images_notify_once_each_with_paths_and_provenance>
        <Function test_failed_write_yields_one_failed_notification_and_no_applied_one>
        <Function test_missing_prediction_is_skipped_not_applied>
        <Function test_partial_failure_never_claims_the_whole_batch_succeeded>
        <Function test_absent_or_broken_controller_never_breaks_annotation_saving>
      <Module test_checkpoint.py>
        Tasks 3.4-3.5 -- save checkpoints, save failure, save-as forking and
        recovery of an interrupted session.
        
        Covers spec ``STO-4`` (a saved revision and the draft stay in sync), ``STO-5``
        (a failed save keeps the last saved version and the draft process), ``STO-6``
        (save-as forks a new round without touching the old one), ``BASE-8.1``
        (unobserved content or an external annotation change is disclosed as a gap,
        never presented as a complete comparison) and ``TIM-8`` (an unclosed session
        is marked ``interrupted-time``).
        <Function test_saved_advances_revision_and_matches_the_draft>
          验证 STO-4：prepare_save()→saved() 推进 revision，且已保存视图与草稿视图一致。
        <Function test_failed_save_keeps_saved_revision_and_draft_process>
          验证 STO-5：save_failed() 后已保存版本不变、草稿过程保留、token 失效。
        <Function test_save_as_forks_a_new_round_and_keeps_the_old_one>
          验证 STO-6：保存到不同路径分叉出新轮次，旧轮次的已保存版本不受影响。
        <Function test_unobserved_content_change_is_flagged>
          验证 BASE-8.1：prepare_save() 收到与草稿不一致的内容时披露 unobserved-content-change。
        <Function test_reopening_with_a_matching_pending_checkpoint_restores_saved_state>
          验证 STO-4：重开时磁盘内容与 pending 检查点一致 → 恢复为已保存、不记缺口。
        <Function test_reopening_against_a_changed_file_flags_external_annotation_change>
          验证 BASE-8.1：重开时标注文件与已知版本不同 → external-annotation-change，不冒充完整。
        <Function test_changed_image_digest_starts_a_new_round_and_flags_it>
          验证 BASE-1：同一路径但图片内容变化 → 新轮次 + image-content-changed，旧轮次保留。
        <Function test_unclosed_session_is_marked_interrupted_time>
          验证 TIM-8：上次未闭合的计时会话在重开时被标记 interrupted-time，时长仍保留。
        <Function test_finish_requires_a_clean_saved_round>
          验证 EVT-8/STO-4：有未保存改动或待定检查点的轮次不能完成，干净轮次可完成且幂等。
        <Function test_saved_rejects_a_foreign_or_stale_token>
          验证 STO-4/STO-6：其他轮次或已失效的 token 不能把当前草稿标记为已保存。
